            "detailed_description": "<h1>Interkosmos is perfect for...</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/47e25ed684c997b4abf77545fd2d8204.avif?t=1780168865\" width=972 height=800 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE 1970s SPACE RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a<strong> thrilling VR space adventure </strong>where every button matters and survival is a puzzle<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a nimble astronaut inside <i>&quot;<strong>Zvezda</strong>&quot;</i> - a highly experimental capsule. Surrounded by a fully interactive cockpit and caught in a rapidly escalating Cold War conflict, you must adapt on the fly. Execute the right procedures, manage your power and life support systems, and try to land in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck, pilot. You're going to need it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate VR Interactivity:</strong> A claustrophobic, realistic space capsule where you can manipulate every single piece of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Comedy:</strong> A captivating story with full professional voice acting that perfectly balances tension with a heavy dose of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Multi-Tasking:</strong> Keep your cool and improvise while managing complex, cascading system failures during re-entry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional Replayability:</strong> Multiple endings, branching paths, and unpredictable events guarantee that no two flights are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals:</strong> Powered by Unreal Engine, featuring crisp retro graphics and a stellar sound design that makes you feel truly disconnected from Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/731d3ec6555d10af507752ddc94ba7ed.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME TO THE 1970s SPACE RACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for a<strong> thrilling VR space adventure </strong>where every button matters and survival is a puzzle<strong>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a nimble astronaut inside <i>&quot;<strong>Zvezda</strong>&quot;</i> - a highly experimental capsule. Surrounded by a fully interactive cockpit and caught in a rapidly escalating Cold War conflict, you must adapt on the fly. Execute the right procedures, manage your power and life support systems, and try to land in one piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck, pilot. You're going to need it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/0befaba59f6b8f1b754ca5bdff076304.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultimate VR Interactivity:</strong> A claustrophobic, realistic space capsule where you can manipulate every single piece of equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven Comedy:</strong> A captivating story with full professional voice acting that perfectly balances tension with a heavy dose of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Multi-Tasking:</strong> Keep your cool and improvise while managing complex, cascading system failures during re-entry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional Replayability:</strong> Multiple endings, branching paths, and unpredictable events guarantee that no two flights are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals:</strong> Powered by Unreal Engine, featuring crisp retro graphics and a stellar sound design that makes you feel truly disconnected from Earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.poster.avif?t=1780168865\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.webm?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/579110/extras/077b3165876362f132e959426d06075b.mp4?t=1780168865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
